# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# LFM2.5-24B-A2B, the GPU driving no display: its full 131k window at q8_0/q8_0, the experts of
# 25 of 38 MoE layers in RAM (layers 0-1 are dense), ubatch 1024. Optimized by bench-optimize to
# stage 2 (run lfm25-opt-speed): a smaller ubatch frees compute buffer for two more expert layers on
# the card, the fastest decode at every depth for a third less prompt speed (docs/bench.md). The
# budget is Qwen3.6's, which meets docs/agent.md#context-budget at this window.
: "${MODEL:=lfm25-24b}"
: "${CTX:=131072}"
: "${CPU_MOE:=27}"
: "${UB:=1024}"
: "${BUDGET:=16384}"
: "${MAX_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${RESERVE_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${KEEP_RECENT_TOKENS:=24000}"
